{"code":"YL07","wikidata":"Q119726019","wikipedia":{"en":"Lat Phrao 101 MRT station","th":"สถานีลาดพร้าว 101"},"summary":{"en":"Lat Phrao 101 station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Lat Phrao Road, near Soi Lat Phrao 101 in Bang Kapi District, Bangkok. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีลาดพร้าว 101 เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนลาดพร้าวในพื้นที่เขตบางกะปิ กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-06-12","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Lat_Phrao_101_Station_01.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_101_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_101_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Lat_Phrao_101_Station_02.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_101_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_101_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Lat_Phrao_101_Station_03.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_101_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_101_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Lat_Phrao_101_Station_04.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_101_Station_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_101_Station_04.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Lat_Phrao_101_Station_05.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_101_Station_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_